+ * (0,0,0,1.0)) and 16-bit coordinates. Bounds-check against the buffer
+ * size: an out-of-bounds fetch goes to x = size, RGB is forced to 0 and
+ * the alpha is the inverted hardware alpha (no format in the shader).
